// 03_search.bund — Cluster-wide search variants.
//
// Each `cls.search*` helper fans out the matching v2/* method to
// every Alive peer and merges by UUID dedup + score average (or the
// per-method strategy described in src/cluster/merge.rs).
//
// All three of these accept a string query and a duration window.

// ── BM25 full-text returning ranked (id, score) hits ──────────────
"error"  "1h" 10  cls.fulltext

// ── vector search returning matched documents ─────────────────────
"login failures"  "1h"  cls.search

// ── combined observability + document semantic search ─────────────
// Returns {observability: [...], documents: [...]} in one pass.
"network outage"  "1h"  cls.aggregation

// ── echo the meta of the LAST cluster call (cls.aggregation) ──────
?cluster.meta.
